    {
      "date": "2026-08-28",
      "reason": "RE-128 CLINE crosswalk, answered by the RE runner and cross-checked by this lane: SCENE_NAME[BG0001].n_CLINE_TYPE=1 -> CLINE[(1,<Mob-Set number>)].n_LEADER_BK1 = the real MOBS.n_ID. GT-078 OWNER-REJECTED had put the scene file's Mob-Set number on the wire as make_npc_attr's template u16 (every placement right, every NPC wrong).",
      "change": "_entry() now sends world_port_royal_identity's resolved MOBS.n_ID, that MOBS row's own s_OUTFIT and its MOBS_TIP name instead of placement.template_id / visual_preset / source_name, and no longer sends the V119 'Tornado Eagle' name override for placement 30 (its Mob-Set 31 resolves to 248 Da Vinci). census_order() drops every placement whose Mob-Set number has no shippable identity, so a full-census request now ASSEMBLES 108 of the 115 frozen rows and build_world_population records the shortfall as count_source=identity_resolved. Both membership AND per-entry bytes moved at every rung; the P30 hp override (V117) is unchanged.",
      "superseded_pc_frame_bytes_at_both_anchors": {
        "3": [
          564,
          577
        ],
        "20": [
          3567,
          3580
        ],
        "60": [
