        91
      ],
      "note": "the superseded numbers stay here rather than being deleted - they are still correct for what they described: a census that shipped Mob-Set numbers as identities, which is the world the owner rejected on sight in GT-078. The 115 target is NOT rewritten to 108 anywhere in this file: 115 is still the source count and still what the console line reports the shortfall against."
